      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Petro, ya/abusmoó Yesu Kristo, barwaárí ngina gooiím amór múk taa tsawaár oo Mungú, oo aa diyaayaa/aat, oo baraá yaamaá dahaayi'iimár wa hoót, baraá yaamaá Ponto nee Galatia nee Kapadokia nee Asia nee Bitinia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' tunduna tsawaár as adoodá' Mungú Baabá inósuú kilá' aa slaá', as kuungá' tunduwa múk hhohhó' tleehhi ar Qeeruuwós, nee as Yesu Kristo kuwa ilaiwawa/a' nee tunduwa tseerér Yesu Kristó i hikimiisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsuuqaá Mungú nee wayduuwós i ló'wa doogine' dirhunge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú Baabuú Aakoorén Yesu Kristo i xirfuuti. Inós atén tina sagaáwa tsár wa laqwaál ar gurtleemuuwós oo yaariír, qoomár Yesu Kristo nguwa waaslee/atís baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale, as atén harahhifór slafiingw kawa slawaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee aalír hhitiruutaaká a slawaán tidá' ta meetagaasiiká, slám i /otská. Tidá' ta gawaá doorí wa amohhe'eemisi as atén. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' tundun de'én nee /uuruú Mungú ar loohír haratlintaao, as ba/amadá' taa qaroó amohhe'eés kawa ilaota', tidá' tindi geehhooeesi bál deelór alhhe'eesaywo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kuungá' a ló'wa qwalaala/á', ala tam gurhaamuta'a qoomaarí niinawe as iiara'aduú dimbadimbé, asma adoorí i pa/aká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiara'aduuwí gídaabárós i deer. A haratlintaaorhúng kan iiara'ar, xáda xáy haratlintaaorhúng tisíng ar lóe? Sahaábu a gár qwaar, tam ku iiari ar baraá asltadár sahaábu kur hhoohhooeemiis. Ala haratlintaaorhúng ka ló'wa afhhamít ta sahaábuwo. Asma haratlintaaorhúng bar kaa iiár, i hariín kawa diidi'iimiisi nee kawa xirfayeemisi nee kan ilaiwawaa/ qoomár Yesu Kristo burkwa geehhooés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' inós u sla'á' tam ugwa aandi'iikahe. Slám inós u haratlintaatiá' tam hamí u ara'aanda'aakahe. Kuungá' u sageeqwalaala/á' ar qwal/uú xirfuú koóm, kudá' alki/ituuwo ta aleesleera'aaká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asma haratlintaaorhúng gár i huwaahup a ba/amár munerhúng.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba/amarí an tidá' aaruuse aa leelehhít nee aa tsee/aariín. Aaruuseedá' ina aaririín kángw ba/amadá' kuungá' nu i hardaha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qooma gari leelehhít axáy i tleehharuuti a qooma gaalá, nee a qoomár adoomá. Asma Qeeruú Kristo, kudá' baraaín i dirií', kángw qoomaadá' gwa qaro geerií oó', nee slahha'amaayér Kristo i slay gari dir'ín i lamaabu'ún, nee xirfuú i slay aluudae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí kuri dir'ín i gwa/atís adór inooín kaangwí gár kus kaahi tar inooineeká, ala as kuungá'. Nee hám daxta kaangwí kunga oó' dirhunge nee mukdá' Ya/abtór hho' ngaa dirhúngií alki/iit ar loohír Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú, kudá' tinda ya/aáw gawaá doorí wa ale. Muruuwí tam malayke sleeme gun ilatleerús nguwa artá wa sla'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe inqwaruuhúng siinootaak, nee ta dal'á'. Kuungá' masók tsuuqaadá' tindi haniisi qoomár Yesu Kristo burkwa geehhooeés, in ló'wa harahhifá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' masók a na/aá ilaiwa/amér koomá', slám ma kumiitara' tunduwa uuruxun nee ilatleerirhúng, tidá' taa eehadé' qoomár tunduwa iimi boó/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudá' kuungá' naa ateet ku hhoohhoó'. Gawaá adoorihe kuungá' sleeme masók a múk hhohhó' baraá muruudá' sleémeero ta tlehhita'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Gooi i kat, «Kuungá' masók a múk hhohhó', asma aníng ti hhoohhoó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' Mungú bur firiiriindá', un Baabár ateetiindá', inósuudá' umuúqo heewo gu sakwasleemuút ar qoomoó tlehhemi'iiwós ar barqaanti wasle. Gawaá adoorihe, kuungá' hooté' ar Mungú kuwa ilaiwawa/a' baraá qoomaarí tawa hota' baraakaá yaamuú wa ale adór dahaaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a xuá' adór gár tundura tlaáxw tar muruudá' hhitiruumitaaká, a peesaarooká, laqaá sahaábuwooká, as kuungá' niwa ti'ita' baraá tlehhemi'iihúng kudá' hariima'aakahe, kudá' taa ilaaoté' dír baabi'iihúng wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala gár kuungá' tundura tlaáxw a tseerér afhhamít ar Kristo, kuduú adór deelmoó bee/i, oo slasla/areeká, oo xaslxaansli wásl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí an gár inós kusa tsawaár nee Mungú iimír yaamu kiwa tleehhiiká, nee hamí baraá deeloorír alhhe'eesaywo kuna geehhooeés as kuungá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' Mungú ugwa haratlintié' ar inós, Munguúdá' inós gwa waaslee/atis baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale, guri xirfuú i haniís. As kuungá' Mungú kuwa haratlintia' nee kuwa haraxua'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' taa hhoohhooesé' asma looeema kiwa ilaiwawa/é', as tawa hota' ar sla'aarír hhaahhafiingw wasl dír hhaeewo. Gawaá adoorihe kuungá' ti ló'wa sla'aaslae' ar mune sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuungá' tunda laqwaál sagaáwa tsare, ar xwaylár slaqwtooká, ala ar xwaylár qeeru. Xwaylarí ina tleehharút ar /uuruú axweesantá Mungú, tidá' slafíngw koom, nee slám i hotaatiín ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
